+        f"MAX_HANDLER_THREADS={max_threads} needs about {need} open files ({FDS_PER_HANDLER_THREAD} per thread plus "
+        f"{FD_RESERVE}), but the limit on this computer is {soft} (hard {hard}). Lower MAX_HANDLER_THREADS in "
